<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FirstFed raised by Goldman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FirstFed raised by Goldman.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it raised FirstFed Financial Corp on Monday to an outperform from its prior rating of perform.</p>
<p>-- Shares added 1/4 to 19-3/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
